# The standalone satellite chart (FR6, specs/running-stations-in-any-k8s-cluster)
# lives under charts/ per the repo's chart-directory convention but is NEVER part
# of this umbrella — it is installed standalone on a satellite cluster. Helm loads
# every directory under charts/ regardless of the dependencies list, so without
# this exclusion the umbrella render would fail on the satellite chart's required
# values (and helm lint would demand it be declared as a dependency).
charts/cluster-agent-standalone-helm/
